{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Sci-Fi RPG on a small map.\u00a0 We meet a humanoid that has arrived on a mysterious alien island on a remote planet in a far away galaxy.\u00a0 Help her explore.\u00a0 Meet some old friends.\u00a0 Or take off in her Spacejet.\u00a0 In this game you can explore a small map.\u00a0 Basically you have a choice whether or not you want to walk around as my character The Spacejet Pilot or Fly.\u00a0 \u00a0The SJP's an Android many distant years in the future.\u00a0 A future where anything technological is indescernable from magic.\u00a0 None of that is in the game.\u00a0 The game you just walk around this small map and maybe talk to some NPCs.\u00a0 If you fall in a hole too bad there's no way out.\u00a0 Controls are simple WASD and Space plus Esc to leave the hole you just fell into and go back to the menu where you can FLY.\u00a0 Yes that's right.\u00a0 Take off in the Spacejet.\u00a0 Fly around a little.\u00a0 There's not much else to do.\u00a0 Enjoy the sunset I suppose.\u00a0 Oh you can fight.\u00a0 If that's what you're into.\u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063760?t=1762976241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063760/34282651e04435a0de76950cd8f6add9f0bfd3f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762976241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063760/e24bc37886a0d564694e4fb6d1736d1f961df907/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762976241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063760/e24bc37886a0d564694e4fb6d1736d1f961df907/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762976241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Sci-Fi RPG on a small map.\u00a0 We meet a humanoid that has arrived on a mysterious alien island on a remote planet in a far away galaxy.\u00a0 Help her explore.\u00a0 Meet some old friends.\u00a0 Or take off in her Spacejet.\u00a0 In this game you can explore a small map.\u00a0 Basically you have a choice whether or not you want to walk around as my character The Spacejet Pilot or Fly.\u00a0 \u00a0The SJP's an Android many distant years in the future.\u00a0 A future where anything technological is indescernable from magic.\u00a0 None of that is in the game.\u00a0 The game you just walk around this small map and maybe talk to some NPCs.\u00a0 If you fall in a hole too bad there's no way out.\u00a0 Controls are simple WASD and Space plus Esc to leave the hole you just fell into and go back to the menu where you can FLY.\u00a0 Yes that's right.\u00a0 Take off in the Spacejet.\u00a0 Fly around a little.\u00a0 There's not much else to do.\u00a0 Enjoy the sunset I suppose.\u00a0 Oh you can fight.\u00a0 If that's what you're into.\u00a0\u00a0</p>","developers":["Corey Dimond"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063760/1aa6571d3fa3b111c9efc0d241d169810a7566e7/header.jpg?t=1762976241","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063760/1789253650/bf3a4520ef33a1f4f6c293ddb9e3d9ed73dab571/1762969635/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762976240","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4063760/1789253650/bf3a4520ef33a1f4f6c293ddb9e3d9ed73dab571/1762969635/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762976240","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea